## 1.0.0 (unreleased)

Viewer-only restructure of the repository:
- Removed the editor Flask backend, staging and legacy build artifacts
- Replaced webpack with Vite (dev/build/preview), default project layout
- Converted the source to strict TypeScript (target ES2022)
- Replaced Leaflet with OpenLayers; IIIF Image API replaces Zoomify (breaking)
- Converted Less to SASS; fonts bundled from npm (@fontsource) instead of runtime CDN requests
- Added a JSON Schema for storymap data, runtime validation with console reporting, and a CLI validator
- Added ESLint + Stylelint and GitHub Actions for linting/tests and release packaging
- Playwright e2e suite over all examples, Vitest for units
- Dropped code paths for pre-2022 browsers (legacy vendor prefixes, IE/old-engine fallbacks)
